  "content": "<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kcbhosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1238331/description_72efb716-6725-4885-8014-b3942ff9b561.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a> 相容性為 Prettier Horses 套裝！重新建模並重新紋理馬匹，超過 126 種組合！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>原始套裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/prettier-horses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此</a>。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e4f54370-e9e6-4220-91f3-17cff01fd426.png\" alt=\"Vanilla Horse vs Prettier Horse\" width=\"800\" height=\"542\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>此外，還有一些獨角獸名牌變體，透過將不同顏色的馬命名為「獨角獸」，或在深色橡木森林中。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>Credit to FreshLX for their amazing Fresh Animations resource pack!</em></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>相容性</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>必須</strong></span> 安裝並放在<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">此套裝下方</span></strong>才能運作</li>\n<li style=\"text-align-left\">此資源套裝需要<strong>Optifine</strong>或<strong>Entity Texture Features 和 Entity Model Features</strong>模組才能運作！</li>\n<li style=\"text-align-left\">推薦使用 Entity Model Features，因為與兩套裝配合更佳</li>\n<li style=\"text-align-left\"><em><strong>此套裝應與大多數重新紋理或新增馬鞍的套裝/模組相容！</strong></em></li>\n<li><em><strong>此套裝無法與其他編輯或修改馬匹模型或紋理的套裝一起使用</strong></em><em><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0c2247f9-84b7-4484-8f4e-60cc55259a94.png\" width=\"431\" height=\"292\"></strong></em></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/w53BkM9Byy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1238331/description_84e5a74c-2c10-4fd8-b2ec-a2a35c12b7c6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"122\" height=\"66\"></a></p>",
